{"title": "Gem Valuables Table", "pageid": 15094, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Gem_Valuables_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Valuables tables", "Leveled drop tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Gem Valuables Table</b>, also known as <code>Valuables_Gems</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Valuables_Gems+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Valuables_Gems+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> that contains a variety of gems. It is used throughout the game whenever a gem is desired as a drop.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_Table\">Drop Table</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Gem Valuables Table}}</code>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Level</th>\n<th>Average value\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 - 4</td>\n<td>27.5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 - 6</td>\n<td>32.5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7 - 8</td>\n<td>48.3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9+</td>\n<td>116.1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>All</td>\n<td>61.3\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Up to level 4</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gemstone_Categories/PreciousGem\